{
  "config": {
    "info": {
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "description": "Sprint Contract + Context Reset + Environment Bootstrapping による長時間安定実行",
      "copyright": "Copyright 2026",
      "author": "Akira Kudo"
    },
    "recursionLimit": 150,
    "eventEmitter": {
      "defaultMaxListeners": 10
    },
    "contextGuard": {
      "enabled": true,
      "modelContextLimit": 200000,
      "thresholdRatio": 0.7
    }
  },
  "stateAnnotation": {
    "name": "FullHarnessState",
    "type": "Annotation.Root"
  },
  "annotation": {
    "messages": {
      "type": "BaseMessage[]",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => x.concat(y)",
      "default": "[]"
    },
    "activeMessages": {
      "type": "BaseMessage[]",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => { const isReset = y.length === 1 && typeof y[0].content === 'string' && (/^=== (Context Reset|Generator Bootstrap|Evaluator Bootstrap|Feedback Bootstrap)/).test(y[0].content); return isReset ? y : x.concat(y); }",
      "default": "[]"
    },
    "taskSpec": {
      "type": "string",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => y",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    "sprintContract": {
      "type": "{ goals: string[]; successCriteria: string[]; sprintNumber: number } | null",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => y",
      "default": "null"
    },
    "sprintResult": {
      "type": "{ passed: boolean; feedback: string; score: number } | null",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => y",
      "default": "null"
    },
    "retryCount": {
      "type": "number",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => x + y",
      "default": "0"
    },
    "estimatedContextTokens": {
      "type": "number",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => y",
      "default": "0"
    },
    "contextResetCount": {
      "type": "number",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => x + y",
      "default": "0"
    },
    "lastContextResetAt": {
      "type": "string | null",
      "reducer": "(x, y) => y",
      "default": "null"
    }
  },
  "models": [
    {
      "id": "planner_model",
      "type": "LlamaCpp",
      "config": {
        "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B",
        "temperature": 0.3,
        "serverUrl": "http://localhost:8001"
      },
      "bindSystemSkills": true,
      "skills": {
        "enabled": true,
        "skillsPath": "skills",
        "backend": {
          "virtualMode": true,
          "rootDir": "."
        }
      },
      "systemPrompt": "あなたはプロジェクトプランナーです。ユーザーの指示を元に、詳細な実装仕様(taskSpec)を作成してください。必ず具体的な実装計画を出力してください。質問や確認は行わず、推測して計画を立ててください。"
    },
    {
      "id": "negotiator_model",
      "type": "LlamaCpp",
      "config": {
        "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B",
        "temperature": 0.3,
        "serverUrl": "http://localhost:8001"
      },
      "bindSystemSkills": true,
      "skills": {
        "enabled": true,
        "skillsPath": "skills",
        "backend": {
          "virtualMode": true,
          "rootDir": "."
        }
      },
      "systemPrompt": "あなたはSprintネゴシエーターです。taskSpecを参考に、次スプリントのgoalsとsuccessCriteriaをsprintContractとして返してください。必ず以下のJSON形式で出力してください: {\"goals\": [\"...\"], \"successCriteria\": [\"...\"], \"sprintNumber\": 1}"
    },
    {
      "id": "generator_model",
      "type": "LlamaCpp",
      "config": {
        "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B",
        "temperature": 0.3,
        "serverUrl": "http://localhost:8001"
      },
      "bindSystemSkills": true,
      "skills": {
        "enabled": true,
        "skillsPath": "skills",
        "backend": {
          "virtualMode": true,
          "rootDir": "."
        }
      },
      "systemPrompt": "あなたは実装エンジニアです。sprintContract.goalsに記載されたゴールを実装してください。実装後、そのサマリーと自己評価をmessagesに追加してください。"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluator_model",
      "type": "LlamaCpp",
      "config": {
        "model": "unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B",
        "temperature": 0.3,
        "serverUrl": "http://localhost:8001"
      },
      "bindSystemSkills": true,
      "skills": {
        "enabled": true,
        "skillsPath": "skills",
        "backend": {
          "virtualMode": true,
          "rootDir": "."
        }
      },
      "systemPrompt": "あなたは品質評価エージェントです。sprintContract.successCriteriaに基づき実装を評価してください。必ず以下のJSON形式で出力してください: {\"sprintResult\": {\"passed\": true/false, \"feedback\": \"...\", \"score\": 0-100}} scoreが80以上の場合のみpassedをtrueにしてください。"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "bootstrap_planner_node",
      "type": "function",
      "handler": {
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "state",
            "parameterType": "state",
            "stateType": "typeof FullHarnessState.State"
          }
        ],
        "output": {},
        "functionFile": "json/functions/bootstrap_planner_node_2.js"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "planner_node",
      "type": "function",
      "handler": {
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "state",
            "parameterType": "state",
            "stateType": "typeof FullHarnessState.State"
          },
          {
            "name": "model",
            "parameterType": "model",
            "modelRef": "planner_model"
          }
        ],
        "output": {},
        "functionFile": "json/functions/planner_node_2.js"
      }
    },
    {
